# oracle: fix srd with big triangle particles (four free triangles, 3d, fix nve/tri), slip, overlap yes, shift yes, cubic warn, search 0.2 (a cut-down of examples/ASPHERE/tri/in.tri.srd: the first SRD run only, with timestep 0.002 and 300 steps (was 500) on a box of side 8, and the SRD lattice at density 10 (was 20: 4344 atoms instead of about 10000, the 500-step run took 44 s, the density-10 run 5 s; density 5 changes the rescale count f_2[5] at step 200); the fix deform, the rigid/small molecule of the big particles, the tri/lj pair cut-off phase and the change_box triclinic phase are left out)
# oracle-inputs: w79srd_tri.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-12 abs=1e-13
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box, slip, density 10, 300 steps): the engine agrees with every thermo column (c_tsmall, f_2[1..12] including f_2[5], c_1, etotal, pe and ebig, press) to a relative error of 5.9e-14 (c_1) and with the positions, velocities and forces of every atom to 7.9e-13 (vz, scaled by max(1,|v|)). Slip needs the same neighbor-list rebuild schedule as native (see neighbor.ts fixBuildStep): the rebuild at step 58 is inside the window; the step-275 collision of the density-20 run was measured there and is not re-checked at density 10.
units		lj
atom_style	tri
atom_modify	first big
dimension	3

read_data	w79srd_tri.data

lattice		sc 0.4
region		box block INF INF INF INF INF INF
lattice		sc 10.0
create_atoms	2 region box

group		big type 1
group		small type 2
set		group small mass 0.01
set		group big angmom 0.2 -0.1 0.3

pair_style	lj/cut 1.5
pair_coeff	1 1 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff	2 2 0.0 1.0 0.0
pair_coeff	1 2 0.0 1.0

delete_atoms	overlap 1.5 small big

reset_timestep	0

velocity	small create 1.44 87287 loop geom
velocity	big set 0.1 -0.05 0.08

neighbor	0.3 multi
neigh_modify	delay 0 every 1 check yes
neigh_modify	exclude molecule/intra big include big

comm_modify	mode multi group big vel yes
neigh_modify	include big

pair_style	tri/lj 3.5
pair_coeff	1 1 0.1 1.0
pair_coeff	2 2 0.0 1.0 0.0
pair_coeff	1 2 0.0 1.0 0.0

timestep	0.002

fix		1 big nve/tri
fix		2 small srd 20 big 1.0 1.0 49894 search 0.2 cubic warn 0.0001 shift yes 49829 overlap yes collision slip

compute		tsmall small temp
compute		tbig big temp
compute		1 big erotate/asphere
compute		2 all ke
compute		3 all pe
variable	pebig equal pe*atoms/count(big)
variable	ebig equal etotal*atoms/count(big)

compute_modify	tbig extra/dof -6

thermo_style	custom step c_tsmall f_2[1] f_2[2] f_2[3] f_2[4] f_2[5] f_2[6] f_2[7] f_2[8] f_2[9] f_2[10] f_2[11] f_2[12] c_1 etotal v_pebig v_ebig press
thermo_modify	temp tbig
thermo_modify	format float %.15g
thermo		100

run		300
